 "summary": "The spaciousness dhāraṇās of the Vijñāna Bhairava, in Satsang’s words: notice the space of the room, then the space inside the chest, mouth and skull, feel the skin as a thin wall with open space on both sides, and rest in one field of space.",
 "steps": [
